[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p>Drain the coolant (<a href=\"#/3024733\">0010T84</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025386\">5010B45</a> (left and\nright sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025389\">5010B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025805\">7040A95</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a> (left side)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025480\">5505A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025431\">5040C10</a> .\n(It is not necessary to separate the air conditioning casing from\nthe crossmember).</p><p><a href=\"#/3025429\">5040B32</a></p>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p><a href=\"#/3025429\">5040B32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025431\">5040C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025480\">5505A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a> (left side)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025805\">7040A95</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025389\">5010B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025386\">5010B45</a> (left and\nright sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025840\">7045A10</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (<a href=\"#/3024733\">0010T84</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p>"],[31,63,128,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p>Drain the coolant (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3025840\">7045A10</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025386\">5010B45</a> (left and\nright sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025805\">7040A95</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025610\">5580C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025270\">3350E30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025431\">5040C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025454\">5040D90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025452\">5040D86</a></p><p>1. Undo the lower bolts fixing the protection for the cam and levers.</p><p>2. Release the upper cover retaining springs.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts fixing the upper cover.</p><p>4. Remove the top cover (4a) releasing the protection (4b) from\nthe cam below.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004746.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,128,"<p>1. Remove the evaporator complete with expansion valve and pipes.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004747.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,128,"<p>1. Working at the bench, undo the nuts.</p><p>2. Remove the pipe connector.</p><p>3. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>4. Remove the expansion valve.</p><p>5. Recover the gaskets.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not reuse the old gaskets.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004748.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,128,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the expansion valve is not damaged.</p><p>Fit the new gaskets on the expansion valve\nand then secure it with the bolts.</p><p>Position the pipe connector and secure\nit using the nuts.</p><p>Fit the evaporator complete with expansion\nvalve and pipes.</p><p>Place the upper cover in position and secure\nit using the bolts and the retaining springs.</p><p>Tighten the lower bolts fixing the protection\nfor the cam and lever.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025452\">5040D86</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025454\">5040D90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025431\">5040C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025270\">3350E30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025610\">5580C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025805\">7040A95</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025386\">5010B45</a> (left and\nright sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025840\">7045A10</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p>"]]